# Committed on purpose.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the JavaScript bundle at
# build time, so both values below are already public the moment the site is
# deployed — anyone can read them in devtools. Keeping them here changes
# nothing about their exposure and means a build works on any host with no
# dashboard configuration.
#
# What protects the data is row level security (`user_id = auth.uid()`), not
# the secrecy of the anon key.
#
# The rule this file depends on: VITE_ = public, everything else = secret.
# DATABASE_URL and DIRECT_URL carry the database password and connect as the
# owner, bypassing RLS entirely — they stay in .env.local, which is gitignored,
# and are only ever needed on your own machine for `prisma migrate`.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://wmwheuoaiongyqcwppgc.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6Indtd2hldW9haW9uZ3lxY3dwcGdjIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODc0OTc1NDMsImV4cCI6MjEwMzA3MzU0M30.qTZYgLdXTnBEa3OKKIEMd3x7lyiPVRB_XKQPYeH3iN0
